01.albox.co/seasons/86b3d944-c8fd-44a7-a1d9-4dbea369cd6c.jpg","background_image":"https://cloud01.albox.co/seasons/8557de82-defd-4594-a539-6727056aa222.jpg","likes":11,"dislikes":0,"views":2067,"release_date":"1674604800000","season_number":1,"description":"For her 16th birthday, Mila receives a very special present. Mila can now travel back and forth between different parallel universes to look for her mother, Elis. But Mila soon discovers that her mother's disappearance is just the beginning of the story and her journey. Since Elis found out that several universes actually exist in parallel, she has been hunted by a mysterious group called \"Os Operadores\". Mila has to adjust to this new and extremely dangerous situation and receives support from her friends Juliana, Vinícius and Pierre. Together with them Mila travels the huge multiverse in search of her mother Elis. An unbelievable adventure full of surprises and dangers awaits the friends.\r\n","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":5.2}],"value":5.2,"age":"R"},"background_color":"#d45870","current_season_id":16038,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}